          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n[God\u2019s prayers be upon him, his pure ancestors and]\u00a0\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nexpected [sons].  To him belong the answer to this and to other things, and the lofty opinion\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\non what he has asked, in his worthiness, if God, may he be exalted, wills. Praise be to God alone, and God\u2019s prayers on our lord (Mu\u1e25ammad) and his family, and utmost peace.\n</li></ol>\n",
